Description: The HUPO-PSI mzSpecLib format is a standardized file format to
             distribute mass spectral (MS) libraries and archives. The Spectra
             R package represents the core infrastructure for MS data analysis
             in Biocondcutor. The MzBackendMzSpecLib package provides
             functionality to read and write mzSpecLib files and defines data
             backends enabling import and export of these files to and from
             Spectra objects.
